{
  "title": "Hearty Velvety Cantonese Noodles Lo MeIN",
  "description": "A kid-friendly Cantonese dish featuring lo-mein noodles in a savory sauce, served in a talavera plate. This recipe is a Mediterranean-friendly version of the classic dish.",
